 <div style="padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--surface-1); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:6px;">
    <i class="ti ti-shield-lock" style="font-size:22px; color:var(--text-accent);" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span style="font-size:22px; font-weight:500; color:var(--text-primary);">Password strength & security analyzer</span>
  </div>
  <p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin:0 0 16px; line-height:1.6;">
    A Python CLI that scores password strength using entropy, regex pattern detection, and dictionary checks — and demonstrates secure password hashing.
  </p>

  <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:20px;">
    <span style="font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent);">Python</span>
    <span style="font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent);">Regex</span>
    <span style="font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent);">Entropy math</span>
    <span style="font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent);">bcrypt / argon2</span>
    <span style="font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent);">HIBP API</span>
  </div>

  <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px;">
    <div style="background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:14px;">
      <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:8px;">
        <i class="ti ti-bulb" style="font-size:16px; color:var(--text-warning);" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span style="font-size:14px; font-weight:500; color:var(--text-primary);">What I learned</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.8;">
        Regex for pattern matching · Shannon entropy for randomness scoring · why fast hashes are unsafe for passwords · bcrypt / argon2 salting · k-anonymity for private breach lookups
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:12px; padding:14px;">
      <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-bottom:8px;">
        <i class="ti ti-target-arrow" style="font-size:16px; color:var(--text-success);" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span style="font-size:14px; font-weight:500; color:var(--text-primary);">Why I built it</span>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:13px; color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.8;">
        To go beyond memorizing security tips and actually implement the math and mechanisms behind password safety, from scoring to secure storage.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin-top:18px; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-muted);">
    <i class="ti ti-terminal-2" style="font-size:14px;" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    <span><code style="font-family:var(--font-mono);">python main.py -p "password" --hash-demo --breach-check</code></span>
  </div>
</div>
